Role Summary and Impact

As a Senior Associate, Performance, you will be a vital engine driving client success by supporting your team with the execution and optimization of performance media campaigns across search, social, and display channels. You will directly impact client revenue growth by strategically managing campaigns and identifying opportunities for improved performance. Your work will have a significant impact on the overall success of our clients' marketing efforts, contributing to increased brand awareness and customer acquisition.&nbsp;

• Proactively contributing&nbsp;to achieving client performance goals by implementing effective campaign strategies and optimization techniques.&nbsp;

